 rules : Eat and don't get eaten.","tagline":"Dragon hunting isn't a fairy tale"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Zoé est une petite fille qui croit aux légendes, pas parce qu’elle est naïve mais parce les légendes, elle aime ça. Afin d’aider son oncle le Seigneur Arnold à se débarrasser d’un terrible dragon, Zoé se met en tête de trouver des héros. Et quand elle tombe sur Gwizdo et Lian‐Chu – deux chasseurs de dragon à la petite semaine – et bien tant pis, Zoé décide d’y croire quand même !","tagline":"La chasse aux dragons, c’est pas un conte de fées."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gHjcaVaXVqjYItJzjD5Y8YrXh84.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eK1GCPvhUnWW65yWdGf4QyoBC18.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":10800,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bhHhTCh43aT3kAeknSd5T5BcZcJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhHhTCh43aT3kAeknSd5T5BcZcJ.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bhHhTCh43aT3kAeknSd5T5BcZcJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhHhTCh43aT3kAeknSd5T5BcZcJ.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ovBeydfYEGM5U1omAbp4m2A1Jbx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ovBeydfYEGM5U1omAbp4m2A1Jbx.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pGM9yE4ZbJMKrmvF6HQmVXcWcQr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pGM9yE4ZbJMKrmvF6HQmVXcWcQr.jpg","language":"en","width":659,"height":988},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nTHx3NtYi3C8Of8WsupxCZfVcah.jpg","previewUrl":"ht